#ex:rarefaction-nonphysical-shock","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter3#rem:entropy-condition-uniform-convexity","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter3#prop:rankine-hugoniot-condition","title":"prop:rankine-hugoniot-condition","label":"prop:rankine-hugoniot-condition"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter3#rem:entropy-condition-uniform-convexity","title":"rem:entropy-condition-uniform-convexity","label":"rem:entropy-condition-uniform-convexity"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter3#ex:burgers-triangular-shock-wave","title":"ex:burgers-triangular-shock-wave","label":"ex:burgers-triangular-shock-wave"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter3#thm:riemann-problem-solution","title":"thm:riemann-problem-solution","label":"thm:riemann-problem-solution"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter3#def:shock-entropy-condition","title":"def:shock-entropy-condition","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Shock, entropy condition]\n\\label{def:shock-entropy-condition}\n\\uses{prop:rankine-hugoniot-condition}\n\\dcref{ch3:3.4.1-def-2}\n\\group{Conservation Laws}\n\nAt a discontinuity curve, a shock satisfies Rankine--Hugoniot and\n\\[\nF'(u_l)>\\sigma>F'(u_r).\n\\]\nThe inequalities are the entropy condition.\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter3.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter3#prop:rankine-hugoniot-condition","title":"prop:rankine-hugoniot-condition","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}